# Database — the actual job data.
# synthesis.db is rebuildable from build_synthesis_db.py (which carries
# the schema + seed data + the BASE control job). User-entered job data
# is not committed here. If you want a snapshot, copy the file by hand
# before destructive ops; if you want shared data, that's a different
# problem (live sync to a server, or export/import via SQL dumps).
DB/synthesis.db
DB/synthesis.db-journal
DB/synthesis.db-wal
DB/synthesis.db-shm

# Test artifacts
DB/test_synthesis.db
DB/test_synthesis.db-journal
Frontend/launcher_log.txt

